# The demo hosting's customer zones: what the web app watches by default (dnssecretary serve).
# Every zone is delegated from test. and served by auth1, like the catalogue zones; sign.sh signs
# them (scripts/hosting.sh) and generates their delegations and auth1/hosting.conf from this list.
#
#   <zone>   [<catalogue error the zone starts with>]
#
# The start errors are "at risk" ones, so the hosting has something to show before the demo
# breaks anything. scripts/demo.sh break <zone> <error> breaks any of these zones live.
